---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Hustle Zone YEG" description="Hustle Zone YEG privacy policy. How we collect, use, and protect your data.">
  <article class="lka-legal">
    <div class="container lka-legal-container">
      <div class="lka-legal-head lka-reveal">
        <span class="lka-label">Legal</span>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="lka-legal-date">Last updated: August 29, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="lka-legal-body lka-reveal">
        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>Hustle Zone YEG ("we", "our", "us") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our platform and website at hustlezoneyeg.com.</p>

        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <h3>Personal Data</h3>
        <p>We collect personally identifiable information such as your name, email address, phone number, and billing information when you register for an account or use our services.</p>
        <h3>Usage Data</h3>
        <p>We automatically collect information about how you interact with our platform, including pages visited, features used, time spent, and diagnostic data.</p>
        <h3>Cookies</h3>
        <p>We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to track activity and improve your experience. You can control cookie preferences in your browser settings.</p>

        <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use collected information to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Provide, operate, and maintain our platform</li>
          <li>Improve and personalize your experience</li>
          <li>Process transactions and send invoices</li>
          <li>Send service emails and updates</li>
          <li>Detect and prevent fraudulent activity</li>
          <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share data with trusted third-party service providers who assist in operating our platform (payment processors, hosting, analytics), subject to confidentiality agreements.</p>

        <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
        <p>We implement industry-standard security measures including encryption at rest and in transit, regular security audits, and access controls. No method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure, but we strive to protect your data.</p>

        <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Access, update, or delete your personal data</li>
          <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
          <li>Object to processing of your data</li>
          <li>Request data portability</li>
          <li>Lodge a complaint with a data protection authority</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>7. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>Our platform integrates with third-party services for email (Emailit), analytics (Google Analytics 4), and payment processing. These services have their own privacy policies governing data use.</p>

        <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related inquiries, contact us at:</p>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> privacy@hustlezoneyeg.com<br>
        Hustle Zone YEG<br>
        Calgary, Alberta, Canada</p>

        <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of changes by posting the new policy on this page and updating the "Last updated" date.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  .lka-legal { padding: var(--space-9) 0 var(--space-10); }
  .lka-legal-container { max-width: 720px; }
  .lka-legal-head { margin-bottom: var(--space-8); }
  .lka-legal-head h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-display); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    letter-spacing: var(--track-display); line-height: var(--leading-display);
    color: var(--text-heading); margin: var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-3);
  }
  .lka-legal-date { font-size: var(--text-small); color: var(--text-muted); }
  .lka-legal-body h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-h3); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    color: var(--text-heading); margin-top: var(--space-7);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .lka-legal-body h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-h4); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    color: var(--text-heading); margin-top: var(--space-5);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .lka-legal-body p {
    font-size: var(--text-body); color: var(--text-body);
    line-height: var(--leading-body); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .lka-legal-body ul {
    padding-left: var(--space-5); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .lka-legal-body li {
    font-size: var(--text-body); color: var(--text-body);
    line-height: var(--leading-body); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }
  .lka-legal-body strong { color: var(--text-heading); }
</style>